| Name         | Description                         | Units  |   Default value |
| ------------ | ----------------------------------- | ------ | --------------- |
| `kappa_target`         | Magnitude of target braking slip                         | --  |   0.04 |
| `kp`         | Brake-release gain per unit slip                         | --  |   50.0 |

